"{\"url\":\"https://www.microcision.com/our-capabilities\",\"title\":\"OUR CAPABILITIES | Microcision\",\"desc\":null,\"og\":null,\"robots\":null,\"imgs\":[\"Microcision logo.png | 31e942_ef154a865afe4fa79723417987ebbaeb~mv2.png\",\"_MG_1951.jpg | 31e942_f1bdd7cafb7347c1b6797bf5ee28be41~mv2_d_5472_3648_s_4_2.jpg\",\" | 31e942_2975c14f48244fdeb13221d7eeb5fa92~mv2_d_5472_3648_s_4_2.jpg\"],\"form\":[],\"iframes\":[],\"sha256\":\"ed48bd5fcdb202c5622ed3866693ba1edef064dcb1421412538b04d038267f7f\",\"text\":\"Skip to Main Content\\n\\nHOME\\n\\nSERVICES\\n\\nABOUT\\n\\nEXPANSION\\n\\nCAREERS\\n\\nCONTACT\\n\\nOUR CAPABILITIES\\n\\nFrom design, prototype, to production, Microcision's capabilities include complex drilling, cross-drilling, turning, threading and milling of implants and components. \\u00a0 Every stage of manufacturing and quality is based on ISO 13485:2016 to assure complete traceability. Microcision has years of experience machining titanium, titanium alloys, all surgical grade stainless steels, cobalt chromium and medical grade plastics.\\n\\n\\u00a9 2022\\u00a0by Microcision LLC\"}"
